      "originalText": "1. git install\n2. cmd git --version\n3. create an account in github\n4. Remote Repo in github -- click in repository-new-name\n5. local repo steps(follow steps) -- make a folder with files -- cmd -- \n6. changes follow the commands git add, commit and push.",
